3. Apples
4. Carrots
5. Basil
6. Potatoes
7. Green Beans
8. Blueberries
9. Oranges
10. Watermelons

Let $v_i$ be the value (benefit) per unit and $w_i$ the weight per unit for each product $i$, as given below.

#### Parameters (from data):

| $i$ | ProductName           | $w_i$ (Weight) | $v_i$ (Value) |
|-----|-----------------------|----------------|---------------|
| 1   | Spinach               | 282            | 49            |
| 2   | Shiitake Mushrooms    | 83             | 30            |
| 3   | Apples                | 251            | 30            |
| 4   | Carrots               | 257            | 18            |
| 5   | Basil                 | 88             | 54            |
| 6   | Potatoes              | 52             | 27            |
